\"review-project-title\"><h1>复核募集说明书</h1><span class=\"review-tag\" id=\"review-phase-badge\">已完成</span></div><p class=\"review-muted\">提供复核材料和要求，复核数据一致性、勾稽、政策要求及格式标点，直接在原文留下修订与批注。</p></div></header><div id=\"review-workspace-steps\"><nav class=\"stepper\" aria-label=\"复核流程\"><span class=\"step \"><b>✓</b>选择项目</span><span class=\"step-line\"></span><span class=\"step current\" aria-current=\"step\"><b>2</b>材料与要求</span><span class=\"step-line\"></span><span class=\"step \"><b>3</b>复核结果</span></nav></div><p class=\"review-status\" id=\"review-status\" role=\"status\">文件已加入队列，可继续选择其他材料。可靠准备前，请保持页面打开。</p><p class=\"task-credit-receipt\" id=\"review-credit-receipt\" role=\"status\" hidden=\"\"></p><div class=\"review-progress-bar\" id=\"review-progress-bar\" tabindex=\"-1\" hidden=\"\"><section class=\"task-progress\" data-input-revision=\"1\" aria-label=\"复核进度\"><div class=\"task-progress-heading\"><span class=\"task-progress-dot terminal\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><div><strong role=\"status\">本轮任务已完成</strong><p>请结合已登记成果的实际覆盖与依据阅读结论。</p></div></div><ol class=\"task-progress-steps\" aria-label=\"处理流程\"><li class=\"\"><span>1</span>等待开始</li><li class=\"\"><span>2</span>准备材料</li><li class=\"\"><span>3</span>逐项复核</li><li class=\"\"><span>4</span>保存文档</li><li class=\"current\" aria-current=\"step\"><span>5</span>可下载</li></ol></section></div><div id=\"business-handoff\"></div><div class=\"review-grid review-single-column\" id=\"review-grid\"><section class=\"review-panel\"><nav class=\"review-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"复核内容\"><button id=\"review-tab-materials\" role=\"tab\" data-review-tab=\"materials\" aria-controls=\"review-materials-panel\" aria-description=\"2 份材料\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">材料与要求<span class=\"review-tab-count\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span></button><button id=\"review-tab-results\" role=\"tab\" data-review-tab=\"results\" aria-controls=\"review-results-panel\" aria-description=\"2 项发现\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">复核结果<span class=\"review-tab-count\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span></button><button id=\"review-tab-making\" role=\"tab\" data-review-tab=\"making\" aria-controls=\"review-making-panel\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">本轮任务</button></nav><div class=\"review-tab-panel\" id=\"review-materials-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"review-tab-materials\"><div id=\"review-materials-before\"><div class=\"review-project-info\" id=\"review-project-info\"><div><strong>项目信息</strong><p>合成发行人 · 上交所 · 普通私募公司债</p></div><a class=\"text-btn\" href=\"#/projects/synthetic-review-project?step=details&amp;review_tab=materials&amp;return_project=synthetic-review-project&amp;review_report_id=report-v1\">编辑项目信息</a></div><section class=\"review-scope-guide\" aria-label=\"复核范围说明\"><div class=\"review-scope-heading\"><h3>本次会复核什么</h3><span>四项复核 · 原文修订与说明批注</span></div><details class=\"review-scope-item\" data-scope=\"financial\"><summary><span class=\"review-scope-number\">01</span><span class=\"review-scope-copy\"><strong>财务数据一致性</strong><span>核对金额、期间、单位和合并/母公司口径，检查同一数据在各章节的披露。</span></span><span class=\"review-scope-toggle\">查看详情</span></summary><div class=\"review-scope-body\"><p>对照已上传的审计报告、财务报表及附注；缺少材料时列明缺口。</p></div></details><details class=\"review-scope-item\" data-scope=\"reconciliation\"><summary><span class=\"review-scope-number\">02</span><span class=\"review-scope-copy\"><strong>勾稽关系</strong><span>复算报表合计、跨表勾稽关系及财务指标，标明比较值和计算依据。</span></span><span class=\"review-scope-toggle\">查看详情</span></summary><div class=\"review-scope-body\"><p>保留计算口径和证据位置；识别不清的数字不作为已核实事实。</p></div></details><details class=\"review-scope-item\" data-scope=\"compliance\"><summary><span class=\"review-scope-number\">03</span><span class=\"review-scope-copy\"><strong>政策要求与重点提示</strong><span>列出命中的具体规则条款、适用理由、披露缺口和重点提示。</span></span><span class=\"review-scope-toggle\">查看详情</span></summary><div class=\"review-scope-body\"><p>规则版本、效力或适用性无法确认时保留原文并批注，不编造条款。</p><div data-review-rule-scope=\"\"><p class=\"review-scope-market\">上交所 · 普通私募公司债</p><ul><li>《公司债券发行与交易管理办法》</li><li>上海证券交易所非公开发行公司债券挂牌规则</li><li>上海证券交易所募集说明书编制／参考文本、申请文件及信息披露指引</li><li>募集资金管理、受托管理与债券持有人会议等配套规范</li></ul><p class=\"review-scope-note\">依据本次材料和已载入的规则资料逐项核对。具体条款、版本与适用性在报告中列明；尚未确认的规则或缺少证据的事项标为待核实。</p></div></div></details><details class=\"review-scope-item\" data-scope=\"format\"><summary><span class=\"review-scope-number\">04</span><span class=\"review-scope-copy\"><strong>格式与标点</strong><span>复核标题、编号、引用和中英文标点，保护小数点、千分位和金额表达。</span></span><span class=\"review-scope-toggle\">查看详情</span></summary><div class=\"review-scope-body\"><p>英文或数字之间用英文标点，中文之间用中文标点；结合语境判断。</p></div></details><p class=\"review-scope-note\">有明确依据的建议直接修改并留下修订痕迹与原因批注；不确定事项保留原文并说明缺少材料。成果保存后，由你决定是否设为项目当前版本。</p></section><div class=\"panel-heading materials-heading\"><div><h2>材料与要求</h2><p class=\"muted\">按分区添加材料。单份不超过 100 MB，每个项目最多 60 份、合计 500 MB。上传过程中可继续添加文件。</p></div></div><p class=\"review-upload-summary\" role=\"status\">有原文件需要确认。先核对文件保存和原材料选择；刷新不会自动提交。</p></div><div id=\"review-upload-groups\"><section class=\"material-partition\"><h3>待复核募集书</h3><ul class=\"material-role-list\"><li class=\"material-role\" data-review-drop=\"historical\"><div class=\"material-role-heading\"><div><span>上传需要复核的募集书，支持 Word / PDF</span></div><label class=\"button secondary material-picker\" for=\"review-upload-historical\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 16V3 M7 8l5-5 5 5 M4 15v5h16v-5\"></path></svg><span>点击或拖入文件</span><input id=\"review-upload-historical\" type=\"file\" multiple=\"\" accept=\".docx,.pdf\" aria-label=\"为待复核募集书选择文件\" data-review-upload-role=\"historical\" style=\"\"></label></div><ul class=\"material-file-list\"><li class=\"material-file-row\"><div class=\"material-file-main\"><strong>合成募集书.docx</strong><span>待复核募集书 · 0.1 KB</span><p class=\"material-file-status\">已保存</p></div><div class=\"material-file-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"text-button\" data-review-action=\"delete-material\" data-material-id=\"material-0\" aria-label=\"删除 合成募集书.docx\" disabled=\"\">删除</button></div></li></ul><div data-project-source=\"\"><label for=\"review-project-source\"><strong>本次待复核稿 · 选用项目已有募集书</strong></label><select id=\"review-project-source\" class=\"review-source-select\"><option value=\"\">请选择募集说明书版本</option><option value=\"m:material-0\" selected=\"\">合成募集书.docx · 上传 V1</option></select><p class=\"review-muted\">所选版本只用于本轮复核。PDF 将转换为 Word，版式、表格和分页可能与原 PDF 不同。</p></div></li></ul><details class=\"material-subtypes\"><summary>按细分类别补充材料（选填）</summary><ul class=\"material-role-list\"><li class=\"material-role\" data-review-drop=\"reference\"><div class=\"material-role-heading\"><div><strong>参考募集书</strong><span>选中文件后立即上传，也可直接拖入文件</span></div><label class=\"button secondary material-picker\" for=\"review-upload-reference\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 16V3 M7 8l5-5 5 5 M4 15v5h16v-5\"></path></svg><span>点击或拖入文件</span><input id=\"review-upload-reference\" type=\"file\" multiple=\"\" accept=\".docx,.pdf\" aria-label=\"为参考募集书选择文件\" data-review-upload-role=\"reference\" style=\"\"></label></div><ul class=\"material-file-list\"></ul></li></ul></details></section><section class=\"material-partition\"><h3>审计报告 / 财务报表及附注</h3><ul class=\"material-role-list\"><li class=\"material-role\" data-review-drop=\"audit\"><div class=\"material-role-heading\"><div><span>选中文件后立即上传，也可直接拖入文件</span></div><label class=\"button secondary material-picker\" for=\"review-upload-audit\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 16V3 M7 8l5-5 5 5 M4 15v5h16v-5\"></path></svg><span>点击或拖入文件</span><input id=\"review-upload-audit\" type=\"file\" multiple=\"\" accept=\".docx,.pdf,.xlsx,.csv,.txt,.png,.jpg,.jpeg\" aria-label=\"为审计报告选择文件\" data-review-upload-role=\"audit\" style=\"\"></label></div><ul class=\"material-file-list\"><li class=\"material-file-row\"><div class=\"material-file-main\"><strong>合成审计报告.docx</strong><span>审计报告 · 0.1 KB</span><p class=\"mater